You know you 'd have to give up the case , conflict of interests and all .

310
00:27:55,100 --> 00:27:56,400
Yeah .

311
00:27:56,900 --> 00:27:59,050
Can I ask you a question ?

312
00:27:59,076 --> 00:28:01,225
Why are you doing this ?

313
00:28:02,100 --> 00:28:05,300
What Lily needs right now is a safe , supportive environment

314
00:28:05,700 --> 00:28:07,300
